Do you want only double-quoted text (`"hello"`), or single-quoted text as well (`'hello'`)? The following patch handles **straight and curly double quotes**, including the quotation marks themselves. It applies only to `MarkdownBlock` and leaves code samples unchanged.

Process rendered **text nodes**, not HTML strings, so quotation marks in attributes such as `href="..."` are not modified.

**1. In `MarkdownElement.render()`, immediately after `this.innerHTML = html;`, add:**

```js
